'''Red Sand''' is a {{Common}} block in the [[Mining]] Collection.

== Collection ==
Collecting '''Red Sand''' increases the player's Red Sand [[Collections|Collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of Red Sand.

{{/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Red Sand}}

== Obtaining ==
'''Red Sand''' can be bought from {{NPCSprite|An}} for {{c|20}} per.

=== Mining ===
'''Red Sand''' can be mined on the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}} in:
*{{Zone|Burning Desert}}
*{{Zone|Barbarian Outpost}}
*{{Zone|Dragontail}}
*{{Zone|The Bastion}}

